    "detailed_description": "<h1>New Game Coming Soon</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>uit/</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>QQ Group: 1143247188<br><br>Discord: <br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf53\ud83c\udf4b\ud83c\udf47\u300aFruit: Chain Effect\u300b\ud83c\udf47\ud83c\udf4b\ud83c\udf53</h2></strong><br>Welcome to \u300aFruit: Chain Effect\u300b\u2014a fun-filled puzzle game bursting with fruit and excitement! Embark on an extraordinary match-3 journey in a world brimming with vibrant colors and delicious fruits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf4eGame Features\ud83c\udf4e</h2><strong>\ud83c\udf4cGood Economy:</strong><br>All fruit types are dropped in limited quantities, preventing market crashes and ensuring each fruit is used to its fullest.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf53Diverse Fruit Backgrounds:</strong><br>Explore a variety of fruit scenes, with each level offering a different visual delight.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf4bInnovative Connect Gameplay:</strong><br>New elements added to classic connect gameplay, allowing you to experience the charm of complex strategies within simple rules.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf4aExquisite Sound Effects and Background Music:</strong><br>Enjoy pleasing sound effects and relaxing background music for a comprehensive gaming experience.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf47Item Drop System:</strong><br>Now, you can earn rare fruits randomly while playing the game online. Each time you play, you have a chance to collect up to 120 types of fruit skins, including legendary, premium, rare, advanced, and common varieties.<br>*120 types of fruits and premiums will be gradually released with updates.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf52Market Drop Trading Support:</strong><br>These rare fruits can be traded through the market drop trading system, adding more fun and community interaction to your gameplay.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf49Game Leaderboards and Rewards:</strong><br>Challenge the leaderboards and win generous rewards for ranking high! Showcase your match-3 skills and earn glory and valuable rewards.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udfb5Original Soundtrack Music:</strong><br>Enjoy up to 12 original soundtrack songs, listening to heavenly tunes that add more fun and atmosphere to the game.<br><br>Are you ready? Come and experience the endless fun of fruit elimination in the world of \u300aFruit: Chain Effect\u300b!",
    "about_the_game": "QQ Group: 1143247188<br><br>Discord: <br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf53\ud83c\udf4b\ud83c\udf47\u300aFruit: Chain Effect\u300b\ud83c\udf47\ud83c\udf4b\ud83c\udf53</h2></strong><br>Welcome to \u300aFruit: Chain Effect\u300b\u2014a fun-filled puzzle game bursting with fruit and excitement! Embark on an extraordinary match-3 journey in a world brimming with vibrant colors and delicious fruits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf4eGame Features\ud83c\udf4e</h2><strong>\ud83c\udf4cGood Economy:</strong><br>All fruit types are dropped in limited quantities, preventing market crashes and ensuring each fruit is used to its fullest.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf53Diverse Fruit Backgrounds:</strong><br>Explore a variety of fruit scenes, with each level offering a different visual delight.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf4bInnovative Connect Gameplay:</strong><br>New elements added to classic connect gameplay, allowing you to experience the charm of complex strategies within simple rules.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf4aExquisite Sound Effects and Background Music:</strong><br>Enjoy pleasing sound effects and relaxing background music for a comprehensive gaming experience.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf47Item Drop System:</strong><br>Now, you can earn rare fruits randomly while playing the game online. Each time you play, you have a chance to collect up to 120 types of fruit skins, including legendary, premium, rare, advanced, and common varieties.<br>*120 types of fruits and premiums will be gradually released with updates.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf52Market Drop Trading Support:</strong><br>These rare fruits can be traded through the market drop trading system, adding more fun and community interaction to your gameplay.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf49Game Leaderboards and Rewards:</strong><br>Challenge the leaderboards and win generous rewards for ranking high! Showcase your match-3 skills and earn glory and valuable rewards.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udfb5Original Soundtrack Music:</strong><br>Enjoy up to 12 original soundtrack songs, listening to heavenly tunes that add more fun and atmosphere to the game.<br><br>Are you ready? Come and experience the endless fun of fruit elimination in the world of \u300aFruit: Chain Effect\u300b!",
    "short_description": "&quot;Fruit: Chain Effect&quot; is a link-and-match game where you collect and combine fruits. Obtain fruit items by completing levels or through market drops every 2 hours. Fruits come in Legendary, Rare, High, and Common rarities, with limited drops to maintain balance.",
